      "An overly tight or unsuitable wall mount can stress a curved chassis and display. Mounting position, recent movement and visible pressure points are reviewed carefully.",
      "Curved TV Uneven Brightness Repair",
      "Brightness variation may come from settings, backlight zones, panel stress or display electronics. A neutral test image helps determine whether the pattern changes.",
